  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Afghanistan Reconstruction Trust Fund 2021-2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Afghanistan Reconstruction Trust Fund (ARTF), managed by the World Bank, was a multi-donor mechanism for financing development programs, focusing on education, health, agriculture, rural development, infrastructure and governance. Following the fall of Kabul in August 2021, programming pivoted to focus on humanitarian assistance and basic services.</narrative>
